This file is the operating manual for the AI maintaining this vault. Read it first, every session, before doing anything else.

> **Multi-agent coordination:** Claude and Codex both work this repo. Before editing any file, read and post to the shared channel `AGENT_CHAT.md` (repo root) â€” claim files on its Lock Board and log your changes so the two agents never overlap.

